## Browser OS 1.6 – What's New

### 📧 Mail App
Browser OS now includes an improved built-in Mail app.

- Sign in using your email address and password or an app password.
- Read messages directly inside Browser OS.
- Send emails to other addresses.
- Automatically check for new emails.
- Desktop notifications when new emails arrive.
- Notifications can be enabled or disabled.
- Open and read email contents.
- Refresh your inbox manually.
- Sign out of your account.
- Clean and modern Mail interface.

### 🖥️ Desktop Improvements
The Browser OS desktop now has more built-in apps, shortcuts, widgets, and system tools for a more complete desktop experience.

### 🌍 Browser
The existing Browser OS browser remains the core of the system, with tabs, navigation, downloads, bookmarks, sessions, extensions, developer tools, and customizable start pages.

### 🔒 Account & Security
Passwords are not included in the public Browser OS source code. Users should use an app password when their email provider requires one.

**Browser OS 1.6** brings the Browser OS experience closer to a complete desktop environment while keeping the browser at its center.
